# This New Year will Be Sweet like honey

We have just completed the rhythm Sandia in class. It has been a fantastic start to the year, and this rhythm was such a joy to teach. The rhythm Sandia (also called Lamba and Djelidon) comes from Mali. Sandia means "this new year will be sweet like honey". As always we have [weekly videos](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPAtOjWGbPM) that show the main parts of the rhythm so get your drum and make your new year sweet like honey!! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPAtOjWGbPM
